OL,3,GNEWSAReform MSP quits party to sit as
OL,4,Aindependent
OL,5,
OL,6,FMSP Amanda Bland has quit Reform UK
OL,7,FScotland to sit as an independent.
OL,9,FThe resignation relegates the party to
OL,10,Fthe third-largest group at Holyrood,
OL,11,Fwith one member fewer than Labour.
OL,13,FA Reform UK source told BBC Scotland
OL,14,FNews that Bland was "very difficult to
OL,15,Fwork with" and had been called to a
OL,16,Fmeeting on Wednesday to discuss a high
OL,17,Fturnover of staff in her office.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
