OL,3,GNEWSAReform MSP quits party to sit as
OL,4,Aindependent
OL,5,
OL,6,FBland, who represents Central Scotland
OL,7,Fand Lothians West, said her "principles
OL,8,Fand priorities remain unchanged" but
OL,9,Fgave no details of why she had left the
OL,10,Fparty.
